        "text": "<p></p><p>RainCaper brings art to life through art-inspired gifts and travel essentials. Mother-daughter duo Jan and Lindsay founded RainCaper in 2016 after running a successful local gift store for 24 years.<br/><br/>One of our core values is <strong>Choose Us:</strong></p><p>We want you to feel great about buying from RainCaper. We stand behind the high quality of everything we make and offer attentive and caring customer service. We’re here for you through phone, email or chat!</p>",
